WEBVTT

00:00:17.609 --> 00:00:21.594
CANDY CANDY

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:30.148
Sobakasu nante kinishinai wa.

00:00:30.518 --> 00:00:36.411
Hana pecha datte datte datte oki ni iri.

00:00:37.269 --> 00:00:40.126
Otenba itazura daisuki,

00:00:40.161 --> 00:00:43.514
Kakekko sukippu daisuki;

00:00:43.549 --> 00:00:48.602
Watashi wa, watashi wa, watashi wa Candy!

00:00:49.807 --> 00:00:56.220
Hitoripocchi de iru to choppiri samishii.

00:00:56.255 --> 00:01:02.039
Sonna toki kou iu no kagami wo mitsumete:

00:01:02.074 --> 00:01:08.163
Waratte, waratte, waratte Candy!

00:01:08.198 --> 00:01:11.061
Nakibeso nante sayonara!

00:01:11.096 --> 00:01:14.292
Nee, Candy Candy!

00:01:25.013 --> 00:01:28.281
A pretty young boy appeared before Candy.

00:01:29.240 --> 00:01:33.284
He reminded her of the Prince on the hill.

00:01:36.072 --> 00:01:43.296
"I'd like to meet you again."
Candy wished upon the pendant.

00:01:43.881 --> 00:01:48.576
Am I elegant?

00:01:56.742 --> 00:01:59.575
That's not good, Candy,
the fire is burning too strong!

00:02:02.153 --> 00:02:04.765
Okay, now that's better!

00:02:13.364 --> 00:02:17.500
You'll be in trouble if madam
discovers you here, Candy!

00:02:18.039 --> 00:02:20.984
But there is no other place
I could make bread.

00:02:21.019 --> 00:02:24.485
That's right, you'll make good
use of anything you learn here!

00:02:24.520 --> 00:02:29.052
But Doug, madam is so fussy about
us having to be separate from them.

00:02:29.159 --> 00:02:32.488
What, it doesn't matter at all!
Hey, Candy, it's done.

00:02:32.724 --> 00:02:33.808
Yes!

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:38.986
Wow, it's done!

00:02:40.514 --> 00:02:41.810
It looks really nice!

00:02:42.622 --> 00:02:43.985
It's done, it's done!

00:02:44.011 --> 00:02:46.210
I'll let you have it!

00:02:47.018 --> 00:02:48.366
Thanks, Doug!

00:02:49.106 --> 00:02:50.766
It's done, it's done!

00:02:58.858 --> 00:03:01.847
That Candy, she's going
to see Kurin again.

00:03:02.712 --> 00:03:04.508
I have a good idea, Eliza.

00:03:09.299 --> 00:03:11.990
Mother, why don't we go
for a ride in a carriage?

00:03:12.511 --> 00:03:14.182
Let's go, Mother!

00:03:14.183 --> 00:03:16.907
Well, that's a bit unusual
to hear from you.

00:03:16.942 --> 00:03:19.187
Bring Candy along with you.

00:03:19.611 --> 00:03:21.188
What, Candy?

00:03:22.124 --> 00:03:25.507
That's right. After all, Candy is
Eliza's playmate. Now, call her.

00:03:25.542 --> 00:03:27.515
But Candy is not here right now.

00:03:27.891 --> 00:03:29.458
Where did she go?

00:03:30.324 --> 00:03:32.531
I saw her running around the garden.

00:03:34.166 --> 00:03:37.623
From time to time, she acts out
so selfishly. I don't like that.

00:03:42.719 --> 00:03:46.258
Well, Kurin? Does it taste good?
I made it myself.

00:03:49.610 --> 00:03:53.064
If I work harder, I might get a
chance to meet the Prince again.

00:04:01.046 --> 00:04:03.169
Kurin, hide quickly!

00:04:09.258 --> 00:04:11.717
To find you in such a place, Candy!

00:04:14.009 --> 00:04:17.218
What are you doing in here?

00:04:17.406 --> 00:04:18.758
Something fishy!

00:04:19.104 --> 00:04:20.904
It's not like that...

00:04:23.481 --> 00:04:25.645
Are you telling the truth?

00:04:26.302 --> 00:04:27.925
Yes...

00:04:29.419 --> 00:04:31.574
I wonder...

00:04:34.865 --> 00:04:37.028
Candy! What's up with this bread?

00:04:37.063 --> 00:04:38.011
That's...

00:04:38.836 --> 00:04:42.331
Candy! Have you been eating in here,
the food you stole earlier?

00:04:42.368 --> 00:04:44.356
It's not that!

00:04:44.705 --> 00:04:46.552
Then who was eating it?

00:04:50.139 --> 00:04:52.697
The girl from Pony's home,
she is so filthy!

00:04:54.989 --> 00:04:59.416
Candy, my intention was to take you for
a ride with us, but now I've changed my mind.

00:04:59.451 --> 00:05:01.240
Go back to your room!

00:05:05.389 --> 00:05:10.161
-Brother, let me do it!
-Eliza, you're not strong enough.

00:05:10.196 --> 00:05:11.359
It'll be ok!

00:05:12.501 --> 00:05:16.072
-Eliza! Don't drive them like that!
-Sorry!

00:05:22.054 --> 00:05:24.725
I wonder just what I'm supposed
to represent in this house.

00:05:32.110 --> 00:05:33.500
Kurin!

00:05:37.458 --> 00:05:39.941
It's okay. It wasn't your fault.

00:05:45.487 --> 00:05:49.805
I'm not sure you're good enough to become
one of the Leagans, but you'll have to learn a lot.

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.304
...learn a lot...

00:05:55.373 --> 00:05:58.823
But I wonder if they want me to become
one of them in the first place.

00:06:01.189 --> 00:06:04.779
If I find a pretty dress, just like the
ones worn by Leagan family women,

00:06:04.814 --> 00:06:08.397
and become elegant... that's right!
I'm sure the Prince will...

00:06:08.432 --> 00:06:12.478
He won't disappear so quickly!
He might want to stay next to me!

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:23.357
Okay! I'm gonna work hard
to become elegant like Leagans!

00:06:27.470 --> 00:06:29.762
Did you enjoy the ride?

00:06:30.723 --> 00:06:32.774
It was so fun, Father!

00:06:33.842 --> 00:06:35.240
What happened to Candy?

00:06:36.803 --> 00:06:39.422
That girl is incorrigible!

00:06:42.766 --> 00:06:44.836
What? You caught Candy stealing?

00:06:46.346 --> 00:06:50.167
Maybe that girl from Pony's home is
unfit to be Eliza's companion, after all.

00:06:50.202 --> 00:06:52.878
If she keeps doing that, it won't be
good for the children of this household!

00:06:53.082 --> 00:06:56.932
No. Children of this house need
someone like Candy.

00:06:57.285 --> 00:07:01.499
But... a girl who steals food...
That can't be good!

00:07:01.534 --> 00:07:04.399
Alright. I'll have her
hear from me.

00:07:05.979 --> 00:07:08.465
Women in Leagan family walk like this.

00:07:10.130 --> 00:07:12.760
That's how a classy girl
should walk in public!

00:07:14.375 --> 00:07:16.125
Enter, please!

00:07:16.739 --> 00:07:17.811
Uh...

00:07:18.464 --> 00:07:20.951
Oh, Dorothy! Please enter!

00:07:21.572 --> 00:07:24.267
Mr. Leagan wants a word with you.

00:07:24.710 --> 00:07:26.403
Huh? Mr. Leagan?

00:07:31.877 --> 00:07:36.402
Candy. I'll have to go on a
long business journey.

00:07:36.861 --> 00:07:38.793
When will you be coming back?

00:07:38.828 --> 00:07:44.247
I don't know that. While I'm gone, I'm sure
you'll get along well with Eliza and Neil.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:46.960
Yes.

00:07:48.776 --> 00:07:50.662
That's all, you can relax now.

00:07:52.999 --> 00:07:54.604
What's the matter?

00:07:55.599 --> 00:07:57.847
I thought you were mad at me
for some reason!

00:07:58.947 --> 00:08:01.142
However, I'm a bit angry
about one thing!

00:08:01.726 --> 00:08:03.128
What about?

00:08:04.975 --> 00:08:08.805
It's not good that you
stole that bread.

00:08:09.008 --> 00:08:10.588
It was not like that!

00:08:11.018 --> 00:08:13.220
What happened then?

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.543
It's...

00:08:17.238 --> 00:08:19.701
I want to hear every single bit.

00:08:21.204 --> 00:08:24.505
Would you please come with
me to the barn?

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:26.665
To the barn?

00:08:32.869 --> 00:08:37.675
Please... let me keep Kurin here!
I beg you!

00:08:40.518 --> 00:08:43.053
Kurin, ask him yourself!

00:08:47.376 --> 00:08:50.780
But if I let him stay here,
won't he quarrel with the horses?

00:08:50.815 --> 00:08:54.194
It's okay! Kurin and
horses are already friends!

00:09:02.325 --> 00:09:04.523
I understand, Candy!

00:09:05.504 --> 00:09:07.666
So... it's okay for
him to be here?

00:09:08.351 --> 00:09:13.955
Kurin, you can stay here!
I'm so glad!

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:21.867
What? Kurin is in the barn?

00:09:22.658 --> 00:09:23.796
Yeah.

00:09:24.984 --> 00:09:27.438
Since... since when?!

00:09:27.473 --> 00:09:29.748
Ever since you drove him from the house.

00:09:29.783 --> 00:09:33.281
Candy pretended to have chased him away,
but secretly returned him to the barn.

00:09:33.874 --> 00:09:38.001
And you two... if you knew about this,
why didn't you tell me?

00:09:40.375 --> 00:09:41.726
Kurin, you!

00:09:48.319 --> 00:09:50.433
That Candy!

00:09:51.042 --> 00:09:54.202
I allowed her to keep him if she
promised not to let him in the house.

00:09:54.596 --> 00:09:55.808
Don't want to know about it!

00:10:08.684 --> 00:10:10.244
You're good, Candy!

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:34.486
Ow.

00:10:37.436 --> 00:10:39.012
What happened, Candy!

00:10:39.047 --> 00:10:40.617
It's nothing!

00:10:47.888 --> 00:10:53.917
Sister Pony, sister Lane. Everyone at
Pony's home. How are you doing?

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:59.485
Right now, I'm working hard to
become a member of the Leagan family!

00:10:59.520 --> 00:11:03.294
What, Candy? It doesn't suit her at all!

00:11:04.688 --> 00:11:11.441
Don't laugh! You should support
her in her decision!

00:11:11.601 --> 00:11:15.693
I feel like she went so far away.

00:11:16.539 --> 00:11:23.454
All little birds eventually grow up and leave.
Because they wish to fly away and see a new world.

00:11:23.668 --> 00:11:28.017
Everyone, I would like you to
look up to Candy's new flight.

00:11:33.877 --> 00:11:40.853
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Candy! WOOOOOOOOOOOOO

00:12:01.219 --> 00:12:03.776
What's up with that walk?

00:12:05.264 --> 00:12:08.030
Are you by some chances
trying to look elegant?

00:12:08.602 --> 00:12:11.550
Even Sylvia can walk in a
more elegant manner than you!

00:12:12.008 --> 00:12:13.181
Look at this.

00:12:15.440 --> 00:12:17.772
Sylvia is so pretty.

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:21.005
Yeah, unlike the girl from Pony's home!

00:12:29.378 --> 00:12:31.345
Mother, Candy has...!

00:12:31.380 --> 00:12:33.349
Oh, I'm so sorry!

00:12:34.255 --> 00:12:35.158
Candy!

00:12:40.003 --> 00:12:42.266
What a violent girl!

00:12:42.769 --> 00:12:46.447
If you keep doing these things,
you'll never become elegant!

00:12:46.482 --> 00:12:48.199
Not even a monkey would do this!

00:12:50.261 --> 00:12:51.600
That's horrible!

00:13:01.263 --> 00:13:03.551
It's like Mrs. Leagan said, after all.

00:13:04.319 --> 00:13:07.080
I still don't understand the kind
of life Leagans are having.

00:13:09.762 --> 00:13:12.599
That's right! I'll have everyone
teach me all kinds of things!

00:13:14.573 --> 00:13:17.742
I can teach you, but madam...

00:13:17.777 --> 00:13:19.923
Keep it a secret then, okay? Please!

00:13:20.790 --> 00:13:24.038
I want to learn everything about
the Leagans' way of life!

00:13:24.073 --> 00:13:26.512
I understand, Candy.

00:13:26.547 --> 00:13:28.419
Thank you, Mary!

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:34.591
Listen up, Candy! I'll teach you where
plates, knives and forks go on the table.

00:13:34.626 --> 00:13:35.602
Okay!

00:13:39.946 --> 00:13:41.442
That girl...

00:13:42.643 --> 00:13:48.236
Candy, before washing the dishes,
throw a lot of soap into the water.

00:13:48.572 --> 00:13:50.416
Okay? Now look.

00:13:55.384 --> 00:13:58.316
Incredible! Can I try, too?

00:14:00.654 --> 00:14:05.701
-Candy, you're in high spirits, aren't you?
-My, my, you've got soap under your nose!

00:14:05.869 --> 00:14:06.827
Really?

00:14:06.862 --> 00:14:08.819
It's like an old man's beard!

00:14:13.075 --> 00:14:14.850
Aww, come on!

00:14:16.896 --> 00:14:18.287
Miss!

00:14:30.006 --> 00:14:33.241
Mother!

00:14:34.549 --> 00:14:35.704
Eliza?

00:14:35.739 --> 00:14:38.535
Candy... she doesn't want to be
my playmate anymore!

00:14:39.002 --> 00:14:40.955
Just what are you saying?

00:14:40.990 --> 00:14:45.203
Candy is happier to be with the
staff, than with me!

00:14:57.414 --> 00:15:01.813
Candy, this is how we dance for
the time of harvest.

00:15:03.799 --> 00:15:06.473
Now, I'll teach you, dance with us!

00:15:35.941 --> 00:15:39.056
She came to such a place...

00:15:39.598 --> 00:15:42.887
Mother, why don't you turn
Candy into staff then?

00:15:43.108 --> 00:15:46.298
Yes, Candy might like it
more that way.

00:15:55.535 --> 00:15:59.834
From today, tomboyish Candy will
be reborn as elegant Candy!

00:16:02.995 --> 00:16:07.713
No, no! From now on I won't
be the same old Candy!

00:16:08.647 --> 00:16:11.551
Well, Kurin? Do I look elegant?

00:16:14.285 --> 00:16:16.815
I soon won't be able to
climb trees anymore.

00:16:17.276 --> 00:16:18.620
Okay!

00:16:32.516 --> 00:16:35.543
The prince would get quite
a fright if he saw me up here!

00:16:36.426 --> 00:16:38.077
But this is the last time...

00:16:38.281 --> 00:16:40.861
-Wait up, brother!
-What's the matter, Eliza?

00:16:41.322 --> 00:16:42.495
I heard big news!

00:16:42.672 --> 00:16:45.795
Upon Mother's orders, Candy
is going to become staff!

00:16:45.830 --> 00:16:46.653
Really?

00:16:49.561 --> 00:16:53.858
Mother says Candy will become
our personal servant!

00:16:55.677 --> 00:16:58.241
If that comes true, she won't have
the freedom she enjoys now!

00:16:58.242 --> 00:17:01.242
We'll make her work from
the dawn till late at night!

00:17:01.243 --> 00:17:03.243
And Candy knows nothing of it yet!

00:17:12.413 --> 00:17:13.613
Servant...?

00:17:14.857 --> 00:17:18.090
But I was trying so hard to
fit into the Leagan family.

00:17:18.903 --> 00:17:20.825
But now...
I wonder if it is possible at all.

00:17:27.654 --> 00:17:29.339
I wonder what's with Annie.

00:17:30.379 --> 00:17:33.223
She must be so happy.

00:17:42.021 --> 00:17:47.807
Candy came to the rose gates where
she met the young boy the other day.

00:17:52.142 --> 00:17:55.949
No good.
No matter how long I wait at the gates,

00:17:55.984 --> 00:17:58.759
...the prince is not going to show up.

00:18:00.227 --> 00:18:04.777
Maybe if I look around a bit...
I might find a small entrance.

00:18:14.829 --> 00:18:20.200
What a beautiful forest!
There are so many birds and cute animals here!

00:18:34.799 --> 00:18:38.370
Incredible!
These gates, they look ancient!

00:18:39.781 --> 00:18:41.048
That sign again!

00:18:41.821 --> 00:18:46.798
Maybe this entire estate belongs
to Adleys, just like Stewart said.

00:18:47.045 --> 00:18:51.809
But the Adleys... Maybe the Prince
has something do do with them?

00:18:52.809 --> 00:18:53.716
The Prince.

00:18:55.511 --> 00:18:59.218
That smile... and the light
breeze on my favorite hill...

00:18:59.677 --> 00:19:03.744
I want to meet him again... I'll
go look around the forest a bit.

00:19:14.373 --> 00:19:15.660
Huh?
Come, Kurin!

00:19:25.189 --> 00:19:26.776
Yet another gate!

00:19:29.612 --> 00:19:32.679
A small waterfall is flowing over it...
is it a dam of some kind?

00:19:36.353 --> 00:19:37.730
That sign again!

00:19:38.016 --> 00:19:40.184
The same one on three gates!

00:19:40.219 --> 00:19:44.720
In that case, maybe their household
is much larger than Leagan's?

00:19:45.793 --> 00:19:48.187
I wonder, how is one supposed to open
these gates?

00:19:50.366 --> 00:19:51.719
Don't touch that!

00:19:59.997 --> 00:20:03.628
You, why did you do that!
I could've gotten wet!

00:20:03.703 --> 00:20:06.016
I'm so sorry...!
I...!

00:20:06.650 --> 00:20:09.275
Don't apologize, throw the rope instead!

00:20:09.310 --> 00:20:10.897
Boat is going downstream!

00:20:11.912 --> 00:20:13.617
Where is that rope?

00:20:14.168 --> 00:20:17.718
Right over there!
I'm quickly going downstream!

00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:19.973
Uh, rope, rope...

00:20:20.581 --> 00:20:21.942
Thank you, Kurin!

00:20:21.961 --> 00:20:23.612
Hurry up!

00:20:23.647 --> 00:20:26.597
Okay! I'm good with the lasso!

00:20:29.584 --> 00:20:30.700
Nice.

00:20:44.081 --> 00:20:46.156
I was afraid that I might
have to swim back!

00:20:47.168 --> 00:20:49.263
You got so scared... you can't swim?

00:20:49.298 --> 00:20:51.384
No, I'm a good swimmer.

00:20:51.789 --> 00:20:53.575
Then, what was it?

00:20:54.383 --> 00:20:56.079
See this silk shirt?
It was expensive!

00:20:56.080 --> 00:20:58.310
I didn't want it to get wet.

00:20:58.799 --> 00:21:02.948
He's dressed so well!
And... he smells so nice!

00:21:03.439 --> 00:21:06.642
By the way, miss tomboy,
you're really good with the lasso.

00:21:06.857 --> 00:21:08.176
Really?

00:21:08.739 --> 00:21:10.223
Yes. Where are you from?

00:21:12.199 --> 00:21:15.481
I'm Candice White from the Leagan estate...

00:21:16.259 --> 00:21:18.506
Leagan estate...?
Oh my.

00:21:21.956 --> 00:21:26.010
My ride.
Miss tomboy, see you again!

00:21:26.594 --> 00:21:28.734
Oh, I'm Archibald.

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:34.928
He... he winked at me! He kissed my hand!
He praised me!

00:21:35.338 --> 00:21:39.509
Archibald... I wonder if he has
something to do with the Prince.

00:21:43.666 --> 00:21:45.934
With her sadness soothed,

00:21:45.969 --> 00:21:50.610
Candy returned to her more cheerful,
hopeful self.

00:21:50.936 --> 00:21:53.719
To be continued...

00:21:58.716 --> 00:22:07.283
Ashita wa doko kara
umarete kuru no

00:22:07.318 --> 00:22:16.163
Watashi wa, ashita ga,
ashita ga suki.

00:22:17.053 --> 00:22:25.340
Suteki na koto ga
ari sore

00:22:25.375 --> 00:22:34.464
Watashi wa, ashita ga
ashita ga suki.

00:22:34.893 --> 00:22:42.793
Kirakira hikaru
Kaze no mukou de

00:22:42.828 --> 00:22:53.421
Ano hito ga watashi wo
Watashi wo yondeiru - -

00:22:54.024 --> 00:23:04.241
Candy, Candy, Candy, Candy.
